    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>FullContents</span>\" => \"\"\"
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Once considered the mark of prestige, million-dollar property markets are now a defining feature of Australia&#039;s housing landscape. In 2025, more than one in three suburbs nationwide will have crossed the seven-figure threshold, a record milestone that signals both opportunity and challenge for buyers, sellers, and investors alike.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;blgdet-more-link&quot;&gt;More: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/news/western-sydney-prices-surge-as-buyer-competition-intensifies.html&quot;&gt; Western Sydney Prices Surge as Buyer Competition Intensifies &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;blgdet-more-link&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/public/assets/rmdm-1-min.jpg&quot; title=&quot;&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0px&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;A Record Rise in Seven-Figure Suburbs&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Australia&#039;s property market has undergone a remarkable transformation over the past five years. The share of million-dollar suburbs has surged by more than 140%, driven by steady capital growth, low housing supply, and a wave of infrastructure investments reshaping regional and metropolitan areas alike.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Today, over 34% of property markets, including houses and apartments, have a median value above $1 million, compared to just 14% in 2019. What was once a badge of luxury is now the new normal for many regions across the country.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;In major hubs such as Sydney, Brisbane, and Canberra, the expansion of &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/new-homes.html&quot;&gt;new houses, townhouses, and planned apartments&lt;/a&gt; reflects rising demand from families, professionals, and investors seeking long-term stability in fast-growing communities.&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/public/assets/rmdm-2-min.jpg&quot; title=&quot;&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0px&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;The Changing Face of Australia&#039;s Property Market&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;The million-dollar club has expanded beyond traditional prestige suburbs. Once-affordable family belts and regional growth zones are now seeing their values soar, particularly in Brisbane&#039;s south-west, Sydney&#039;s outer ring, and Melbourne&#039;s northern growth corridors.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;While Sydney still leads with nearly 70% of its suburbs above the $1 million median, Brisbane&#039;s performance has been the standout, adding dozens of new markets over the past year. Even regional centers such as the Gold Coast, Sunshine Coast, and parts of Western Australia are now home to seven-figure price tags once reserved for coastal or luxury enclaves.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;For buyers browsing &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/new-homes.html&quot;&gt;houses for sale or investment property&lt;/a&gt;, this expansion reflects shifting affordability and the growing value placed on livability, infrastructure, and hybrid working lifestyles.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;Affordability Pressure Mounts&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;However, this milestone comes with a growing concern: affordability. For many Australians, the dream of home ownership is moving further out of reach. A household earning an average income with a 20% deposit now needs to allocate over half of its pre-tax earnings to service a mortgage on a million-dollar home.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Even with First Home Buyer Grants Australia 2025 and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/home-loan.html&quot;&gt;home loan calculator&lt;/a&gt; tools helping to guide decisions, the repayment burden remains steep, particularly in capital cities where property prices have continued to climb faster than wages.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Younger buyers are increasingly turning to house-and-land packages, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/new-homes.html&quot;&gt;dual-living homes&lt;/a&gt;, or granny flats to achieve affordability through shared or multigenerational living arrangements. These configurations are not only cost-effective but also align with Sustainable Homes Australia&rsquo;s growing demand, offering energy-efficient, space-smart designs that reduce long-term costs.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;blgdet-more-link&quot;&gt;More: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/news/trimmed-inflation-signals-potential-rate-cut-what-it-means-for-mortgage-brokers-and-property-investors.html&quot;&gt; Trimmed Inflation Signals Potential Rate Cut: What It Means for Mortgage Brokers and Property Investors &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;blgdet-more-link&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/public/assets/rmdm-3-min.jpg&quot; title=&quot;&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0px&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;Regional Markets Catch Up&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;The million-dollar story is no longer limited to the capitals. Regional areas, particularly parts of Queensland, New South Wales, and Western Australia, are seeing record demand as affordability pushes buyers farther out.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Regional property in Australia has gained traction among professionals seeking flexible work-from-home arrangements and investors chasing yield. Coastal regions like the Sunshine Coast, Bunbury, and the Byron Bay hinterland are showing continued resilience, offering buyers access to properties for sale that combine lifestyle appeal with strong capital growth potential.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;These markets are now attracting not just locals, but also interstate investors using digital tools such as the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/calculator.html&quot;&gt;Revoy Mortgage Calculator&lt;/a&gt; to identify high-return opportunities without needing to visit in person.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;Why Sellers Are Capitalizing Now&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;For homeowners, the surge in seven-figure markets presents a timely opportunity. Listing activity is on the rise as owners realize that &lt;strong&gt;now is the best time to sell property&lt;/strong&gt; before rising interest rates and buyer fatigue begin to slow momentum.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Revoy&rsquo;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/get-estimated-property-price.html&quot;&gt;property valuation tools: How much is my house worth?&lt;/a&gt; Empower sellers to make data-driven pricing decisions, helping them attract qualified buyers and achieve premium results quickly. As the market matures, experienced &lt;strong&gt;real estate agents in Sydney&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;top agents in Brisbane&lt;/strong&gt; are focusing on strategic marketing, showcasing eco-friendly features, and promoting community-centric developments that resonate with modern buyers.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/public/assets/rmdm-4-min.jpg&quot; title=&quot;&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0px&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;The Outlook: Continued Growth and Diversification&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;According to the &lt;strong&gt;Australian Property Market Forecast 2025&lt;/strong&gt;, more than 80 additional markets are expected to cross the $1 million mark by year&rsquo;s end. Despite higher &lt;strong&gt;interest rates&lt;/strong&gt;, limited supply, robust migration, and cost-of-living pressures, buyer activity is sustaining across both metro and regional areas.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;While the seven-figure club continues to expand, the true story of 2025 lies in how Australians adapt with creative financing, smarter investments, and renewed focus on value for money.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Buyers and sellers who embrace technology, sustainability, and professional guidance will be best positioned to thrive in this evolving property landscape.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;About Revoy&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/&quot;&gt;Revoy&lt;/a&gt; is redefining the Australian real estate experience. As a leader in luxury property and investment solutions, Revoy combines local expertise with digital innovation to help clients make smarter, faster, and more informed decisions.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Whether you&#039;re a first-home buyer exploring &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/new-homes.html&quot;&gt;new houses for sale&lt;/a&gt;, an investor expanding your portfolio, or a seller seeking premium marketing for your property, Revoy delivers unmatched professionalism and precision.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;Contact Revoy&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;At &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/&quot;&gt;Revoy&lt;/a&gt;, we go beyond buying and selling. From property investment to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/home-loan.html&quot;&gt;home loans&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/car-loans.html&quot;&gt;car finance&lt;/a&gt; solutions, our expert team partners with more than 15 leading banks to secure the most competitive rates for every client.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Ready to explore your next opportunity? Discover the latest listings, use the Revoy Home Loan Calculator, or speak with our advisors for tailored property insights today.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8522 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;blgdet-more-link&quot;&gt;More: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/news/why-young-buyers-are-choosing-the-western-sydney-lifestyle-and-affordability.html&quot;&gt; Why Young Buyers Are Choosing the Western Sydney Lifestyle and Affordability&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
