    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>FullContents</span>\" => \"\"\"
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Buying an off-the-plan property can seem like a smart move. It offers a chance to lock in today&#039;s prices while the project is still under construction. However, without the proper knowledge, a promising deal can quickly turn into a financial risk. From unclear contract terms to construction delays, understanding your rights before signing is the best way to protect your investment in the property market.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;blgdet-more-link&quot;&gt;More: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/news/mastering-the-art-of-home-buying-7-proven-negotiation-tips-for-australian-buyers.html&quot;&gt; Mastering the Art of Home Buying: 7 Proven Negotiation Tips for Australian Buyers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;blgdet-more-link&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/public/assets/otpp-1-min.jpg&quot; title=&quot;&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0px&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;Understanding Off-the-Plan Purchases&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;An off-the-plan purchase means buying a property before it&#039;s built. The buyer agrees to a price upfront, often years before completion. This approach appeals to first-home buyers, investors, and anyone hoping to benefit from future capital growth. However, market changes, cost overruns, and project cancellations can turn potential gains into stress.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Legislative updates in recent years have introduced new protections, particularly around sunset clauses, contract terms that allow developers to cancel sales if a project is delayed beyond a set date. Buyers now have more substantial legal grounds if developers attempt to rescind contracts unfairly, ensuring more accountability and transparency in new projects.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/public/assets/otpp-2-min.jpg&quot; title=&quot;&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0px&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;What Has Changed for Buyers&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Tightening property laws in several states has shifted power back toward purchasers. Developers can no longer rely on broad contractual flexibility to terminate agreements and resell homes at higher prices. Buyers now benefit from more precise disclosure requirements, regulated deposit handling, and mandatory notifications for any changes to building plans or delivery dates.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;For example, deposits for house and land packages or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/new-homes.html&quot;&gt;new houses for sale&lt;/a&gt; must remain in trust until settlement. Buyers must also receive a detailed disclosure statement outlining critical project details. Any significant change, such as building design, layout, or access, gives the buyer the right to rescind the contract if it impacts the property&rsquo;s use or value.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;These reforms mean more transparency for people seeking property, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/new-homes.html&quot;&gt;apartments&lt;/a&gt;, or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/new-homes.html&quot;&gt;dual-living homes for sale&lt;/a&gt; under off-the-plan arrangements.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;The Key Clauses Buyers Should Review&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Every off-the-plan contract carries unique terms that can determine a buyer&rsquo;s protection. Attention to the following areas can distinguish between a safe purchase and a financial setback.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Contracts using vague language such as &quot;reasonable efforts&quot; give developers broad discretion and little accountability. Buyers should look for specific deadlines, deliverables, and obligations. Sunset dates should also be reviewed carefully, as contracts allowing indefinite extensions can effectively trap buyers without recourse.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Another key factor is the developer&rsquo;s track record. Buyers should research past projects to assess completion reliability and quality standards. Reliable developers usually publish completion milestones, making it easier for you to gauge performance.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Equally important is funding. Project viability becomes uncertain if construction depends heavily on pre-sales rather than secured finance. Buyers should clarify whether the developer has sufficient capital or relies on early contracts for financing.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/public/assets/otpp-3-min.jpg&quot; title=&quot;&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0px&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;How to Protect Your Investment&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Engaging an experienced property lawyer before signing is essential. Off-the-plan contracts are more complex than standard transactions, and independent legal advice can highlight hidden risks. Lawyers can assess clauses related to changes in design, handover dates, or ownership transfer to protect your position if disputes arise.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Buyers also benefit from reviewing the lease agreement provisions if the plan includes rental options or shared ownership. Clarifying refund terms, deposit conditions, and developer obligations can prevent future conflicts.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;For investors, reviewing the capital gains tax on property and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/get-estimated-property-price.html&quot;&gt;property valuation&lt;/a&gt; aspects early helps in financial planning. Using tools like Revoy&rsquo;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/calculator.html&quot;&gt;Mortgage Calculator and Home Loan Calculator&lt;/a&gt; allows you to understand payment timelines, interest implications, and affordability across the development period.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;blgdet-more-link&quot;&gt;More: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/news/buying-a-home-in-todays-market-expert-dos-and-donts-from-revoy.html&quot;&gt; Buying a Home in Today&#039;s Market: Expert Do&#039;s and Don&#039;ts from Revoy &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;Common Traps to Avoid&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Not all risks come from the contract itself. External factors such as changes in interest rates, rising construction costs, or supply chain issues can delay completion. Buyers must confirm whether they retain rights if a developer sells the project to another entity or faces insolvency.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Some projects offer &quot;the planned apartments&quot; with premium features but lack the guarantee that these features will appear in the final build. Ensuring the contract specifies each included feature protects against disappointment and financial loss. Buyers seeking property with specific features for sale should always demand detailed descriptions and inclusions.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/public/assets/otpp-4-min.jpg&quot; title=&quot;&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0px&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;Why Off-the-Plan Still Appeals&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Despite its complexities, off-the-plan investing remains attractive. Buyers secure homes at today&#039;s prices while the market grows, giving potential capital appreciation when the project finishes. It&#039;s an affordable entry point for first-home buyers, especially with First Home Buyer Grants Australia 2025 or developer incentives.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Renters transitioning into ownership also benefit from this model, particularly when supply constraints make houses and apartments more competitive for rent. For investors, the stability of property investment remains strong, with ongoing demand for new housing across major cities.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;Revoy&#039;s Guidance for Off-the-Plan Buyers&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;At &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.revoy.com.au/&quot;&gt;Revoy&lt;/a&gt;, we help clients make confident decisions when purchasing new developments. Our team works closely with buyers to interpret contracts, evaluate project feasibility, and identify properties with high long-term value. Whether comparing &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/new-homes.html&quot;&gt;investment property for sale&lt;/a&gt;, exploring auction properties in Sydney, or searching for regional property, Revoy ensures every step aligns with your goals.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Our digital tools simplify the process from project tracking and valuation reports to arranging finance solutions with our lending partners. Transparency, expertise, and modern insight define every Revoy transaction.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;Connect with Revoy&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.revoy.com.au/&quot;&gt;Revoy&lt;/a&gt; helps you navigate Australia&rsquo;s property market with clarity and confidence. From reviewing off-the-plan contracts to securing finance, we&#039;re here to make your next move safe and successful. Our specialists also offer solutions for &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/refinance.html&quot;&gt;refinancing&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/equipment-loans.html&quot;&gt;equipment loans&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/car-loans.html&quot;&gt;car finance&lt;/a&gt;, working with leading banks to secure the best rates.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Contact Revoy today to explore your next property opportunity and protect your investment with expert advice.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8728 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;blgdet-more-link&quot;&gt;More: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/news/taking-the-first-step-how-young-buyers-are-adding-long-term-value.html&quot;&gt; Taking the First Step: How Young Buyers Are Adding Long-Term Value &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
