  <span class=sf-dump-index>7</span> => <span class=sf-dump-note>array:21</span> [<samp data-depth=2 class=sf-dump-compact>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>id</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-num>384</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>heading</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"69 characters\">Deciding Whether to Sell Your Home for Aged Care or Retirement Living</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>banner_heading</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"69 characters\">Deciding Whether to Sell Your Home for Aged Care or Retirement Living</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>sub_heading</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17 characters\">Retirement Living</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>slug</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"69 characters\">deciding-whether-to-sell-your-home-for-aged-care-or-retirement-living</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>category</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2 characters\">28</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>tags</span>\" => \"\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>Contents</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-const>null</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>FullContents</span>\" => \"\"\"
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Planning for aged care or retirement housing is one of the most critical financial and emotional decisions many Australians face. Choosing whether to sell the family home to fund this stage of life requires a clear understanding of costs, pension rules, and long-term outcomes. It also calls for careful thought about what the home represents beyond its financial value.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;blgdet-more-link&quot;&gt;More: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/news/planning-for-a-fulfilling-retirement-the-four-stages-every-australian-should-know.html&quot;&gt; Planning for a Fulfilling Retirement The Four Stages Every Australian Should Know&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;blgdet-more-link&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/public/assets/rac-1-min.jpg&quot; title=&quot;&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0px&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;Balancing Lifestyle and Financial Security&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p&gt;The family home often holds both memories and wealth. For some, it is the key to funding aged care or retirement living. For others, it remains the emotional anchor of family life. Selling may provide access to care options and lifestyle upgrades, but it can also affect pensions, tax status, and estate planning. The right choice depends on personal needs, health, and financial position.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p&gt;When older homeowners move into aged care, the family home may or may not be counted in asset assessments. If a partner or dependent relative still lives there, its value might be excluded from specific calculations. If the property is vacant, some of its value may be considered when determining aged care contributions. Understanding these distinctions early prevents unexpected costs later.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/public/assets/rac-2-min.jpg&quot; title=&quot;&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0px&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;Considering the Costs of Care&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Aged care fees in Australia combine basic daily costs with accommodation and meanstested charges. Government assistance covers part of these expenses, but individuals usually pay a share based on income and assets. Selling the home can free funds to cover these charges or to pay a lump-sum entry contribution.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Some families choose to keep the property and use rental income to fund aged care. This approach maintains ownership but can affect pension eligibility because the rent is considered income. Discussing these scenarios with a qualified financial adviser helps determine which approach best fits household needs.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;Understanding Retirement Living Contracts&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Moving into a retirement community is a different type of commitment. Instead of buying the property outright, residents often purchase a right to occupy under a long-term agreement. When leaving, the operator may deduct a management or exit fee from the resale value. These deductions can reduce the amount returned to the resident or their estate.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Each village applies its own structure for fees, refurbishment costs, and shared capital gains. Reviewing the contract carefully ensures full awareness of the amount paid upon entry and the amount received upon exit. Independent advice protects both assets and peace of mind.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/public/assets/rac-3-min.jpg&quot; title=&quot;&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0px&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;How Pensions and Centrelink Rules Apply&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p&gt;The decision to sell the home has direct implications for government benefits. When a person moves into care, their home is generally exempt from pension asset tests for up to two years if unsold. If a spouse continues to live there, the exemption can continue indefinitely.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p&gt;If the property is sold and the proceeds are used to pay aged care accommodation costs, those funds are typically excluded from pension calculations. However, if the proceeds remain as cash or investments, they will count as assets and may reduce the pension amount. For this reason, structuring the sale and allocation of funds with expert advice is essential.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;Tax and Legal Considerations&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p&gt;In most cases, selling a primary residence in Australia does not trigger capital gains tax. The exemption applies when the property has been used solely as the principal place of residence. If it has been rented or used for income purposes, some capital gain may apply.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Renting out the home while in care creates taxable income, but related costs such as maintenance and interest on loans may be deductible. Planning with a tax professional ensures compliance and maximizes any benefits available under current laws.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/public/assets/rac-4-min.jpg&quot; title=&quot;&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0px&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;Emotional and Family Factors&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Financial reasoning alone rarely decides this issue. The family home often carries decades of memories, making the choice deeply emotional. Many families find it helpful to hold open discussions early, addressing expectations about inheritance, future care, and housing needs. This shared approach supports unity and transparency through what can be a sensitive process.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Remaining connected to family while transitioning into aged care or retirement living helps maintain stability and comfort. The goal is to find an arrangement that provides both financial sustainability and personal satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;blgdet-more-link&quot;&gt;More: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/news/planning-retirement-before-pension-age-property-and-financial-solutions.html&quot;&gt; Planning Retirement Before Pension Age: Property and Financial Solutions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;Finding the Right Path&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Every situation is different. Some homeowners may sell to fund new accommodation and simplify their lifestyle. Others may retain ownership as part of a broader financial strategy. Evaluating aged care costs, pension rules, tax obligations, and family preferences together gives the clearest picture of what works best.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Making the decision early, with guidance from trusted professionals, allows time to plan confidently and avoid rushed choices during health or financial stress.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/public/assets/rac-5-min.jpg&quot; title=&quot;&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0px&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;About Revoy&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.revoy.com.au/&quot;&gt;Revoy&lt;/a&gt; helps people navigate life&#039;s major property decisions with confidence and clarity. As a trusted real estate partner, Revoy offers expert support whether you&#039;re &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/new-homes.html&quot;&gt;selling your home&lt;/a&gt;, downsizing, or managing an investment property. The brand combines real estate insight with innovative technology to simplify complex transitions, from buying houses and townhouses for sale to evaluating property valuation and investment property options.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;Contact Revoy&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Revoy understands that property decisions in later life require both financial insight and compassion. Whether you&#039;re exploring downsizing options, assessing &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/calculator.html&quot;&gt;how much your house is worth&lt;/a&gt;, or comparing finance through a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/calculator.html&quot;&gt;home loan calculator or mortgage calculator&lt;/a&gt;, our expert team is ready to help.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7947 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
