  <span class=sf-dump-index>4</span> => <span class=sf-dump-note>array:21</span> [<samp data-depth=2 class=sf-dump-compact>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>id</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-num>399</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>heading</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"48 characters\">The Fastest State for Home Building in Australia</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>banner_heading</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"48 characters\">The Fastest State for Home Building in Australia</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>sub_heading</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"15 characters\">Property Market</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>slug</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"48 characters\">the-fastest-state-for-home-building-in-australia</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>category</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2 characters\">27</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>tags</span>\" => \"\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>Contents</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-const>null</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>FullContents</span>\" => \"\"\"
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Australia&rsquo;s housing market is becoming faster and more efficient as the country embraces new construction practices. In 2025, Queensland stands out as the quickest state for home building, completing new homes in roughly nine months from approval to handover. For property buyers, sellers, and investors following the Property Market Forecast 2025, this signals a turning point in how quickly projects are completed and how supply is keeping pace with demand.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;blgdet-more-link&quot;&gt;More: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/news/victorias-planning-reforms-unlocking-housing-potential-for-a-growing-australia.html&quot;&gt; Victoria&#039;s Planning Reforms: Unlocking Housing Potential for a Growing Australia&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;blgdet-more-link&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/public/assets/tfsf-1-min.jpg&quot; title=&quot;&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0px&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;How Build Speed Shapes the Property Market&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;p&gt;The time required to build a home has a direct effect on property prices, housing supply, and rental options. Recent national data shows Queensland leading with an average completion time of 9.15 months, followed closely by Victoria at around ten months. Other states, including Tasmania and New South Wales, are also improving as supply chain challenges ease.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Faster construction helps expand the availability of houses for sale, new homes for sale, and house and land packages across major cities and regional areas. For renters, this acceleration increases access to apartments for rent, rental properties, and pet-friendly rentals in high-demand locations. Shorter timelines also help stabilize costs and reduce pressure on the broader real estate trends, offering buyers and tenants more flexibility.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;What&#039;s Driving Faster Build Times&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Between 2020 and 2023, construction durations increased because of higher costs and limited material supplies. By mid-2025, that pattern started to change. Access to materials improved, more skilled labor became available, and developers began using technology to streamline every stage of construction. Builders now use modular and off-site construction methods to save time on-site. Expanded trade training and apprenticeship programs are helping close labor gaps. More innovative project scheduling tools enhance coordination, while more consistent building approvals across states reduce administrative delays.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;p&gt;These developments have supported the faster delivery of investment property, dual-living homes, and granny flats for sale. With shorter completion times, more people are now purchasing sustainable homes, benefiting from better affordability and faster project handovers.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/public/assets/tfsf-2-min.jpg&quot; title=&quot;&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0px&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;Benefits for Buyers, Sellers, and Renters&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;p&gt;For buyers, shorter construction periods bring greater confidence and faster access to property ownership. Those exploring cheap houses for sale, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/new-homes.html&quot;&gt;apartments for sale&lt;/a&gt;, or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/new-homes.html&quot;&gt;townhouses for sale&lt;/a&gt; are benefiting from improved supply and reduced delays. Revoy&rsquo;s online tools, including the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/calculator.html&quot;&gt;Home Loan Calculator and Mortgage Calculator&lt;/a&gt;, make it easier to estimate costs and plan financing.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;p&gt;For sellers, quicker completion timelines attract more buyer interest. Using &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/get-estimated-property-price.html&quot;&gt;property valuation tools&lt;/a&gt; and consulting with a real estate agent in Sydney or other regions helps determine &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/get-estimated-property-price.html&quot;&gt;how much my house is worth&lt;/a&gt;. For renters, more housing supply means more options for houses for rent and &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.revoy.com.au/rent.html&quot;&gt;furnished apartments for rent&lt;/a&gt; at competitive prices. This increase in available properties also eases the overall cost of living, especially in high-demand areas.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;The Road Ahead for Australia&#039;s Housing Supply&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Even with the progress, the national housing shortfall remains a challenge. Australia still needs more than 60,000 new homes to meet its targets under the current housing program. Future growth depends on continued investment in workforce training, faster planning approvals, and broader industry participation. Encouraging more women and skilled migrants to join construction trades will remain vital to maintaining productivity and supply momentum.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;blgdet-more-link&quot;&gt;More: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/news/multigenerational-living-reshapes-property-hotspots-across-australia.html&quot;&gt; Multigenerational Living Reshapes Property Hotspots Across Australia &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;blgdet-more-link&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/public/assets/tfsf-3-min.jpg&quot; title=&quot;&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0px&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;Why Revoy Leads the Change&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.revoy.com.au/&quot;&gt;Revoy&lt;/a&gt; continues to lead with modern real estate solutions designed for the digital era. From auction properties in Sydney to regional properties, Revoy simplifies the process of buying, selling, and investing through transparent data and expert guidance. The brand&#039;s focus on innovation and user empowerment ensures that clients always make informed decisions based on current property prices and market insights.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Whether comparing capital gains tax on property in Australia, exploring downsizing options in Australia, or assessing the best time to sell property in Australia, Revoy&#039;s specialists help navigate every step with confidence. Its strong commitment to technology, luxury living, and sustainability defines its position as a trusted partner for both home buyers and investors.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/public/assets/tfsf-4-min.jpg&quot; title=&quot;&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0px&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;h3&gt;Contact Revoy&lt;/h3&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.revoy.com.au/&quot;&gt;Revoy&lt;/a&gt; is here to help you make smart property decisions. Whether you are searching for &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/new-homes.html&quot;&gt;dual living homes for sale&lt;/a&gt;, an &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/new-homes.html&quot;&gt;investment property for sale&lt;/a&gt;, or tailored home finance options, our expert team is ready to assist. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/new-homes.html&quot;&gt;Explore Revoy&#039;s listings&lt;/a&gt;, compare &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/home-loan.html&quot;&gt;home loan solutions&lt;/a&gt;, and access complete property management services designed for long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Revoy also offers &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/refinance.html&quot;&gt;refinancing&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/car-loans.html&quot;&gt;car loans&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/equipment-loans.html&quot;&gt;equipment finance&lt;/a&gt; through partnerships with top lenders. If you want to manage your existing property, lease it out, or build a strong investment portfolio, Revoy guides you at every stage.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;blgdet-more-link&quot;&gt;More: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/news/how-community-focused-living-is-redefining-modern-australian-neighborhoods.html&quot;&gt; How Community-Focused Living is Redefining Modern Australian Neighborhoods &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\">&lt;ul&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Website&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revoy.com.au/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.revoy.com.au&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7461 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Phone:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;tel:1300 702 738&quot;&gt;1300 702 738&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\
